# Solana RPC for Jupiter Perps and spot history. The public endpoint allows only ~1 getTransaction per second,
# so a wallet with a few hundred transactions takes minutes. A free Helius key (~10 req/s) brings that to seconds:
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com

# Optional: CoinGecko key for token prices older than 365 days (spot / Anlage SO).
# COINGECKO_API_KEY=
